Before Amp.iksession and Before Amp.wav were made by the app as it was just
before milestone 9 (the Amp), so the smoke test can check that older sessions
open unchanged (no Amp added) and render exactly as they did.

The session has a guitar track (Yellow Drive, Stack Drive and Tape Echo) and a
bass track (Golden Boost), each playing ../pedals/di_guitar.wav. Before
Amp.wav is its File > Export Song (WAV, 24-bit). Never remake them with a newer
build: that would defeat the point.
